Package: umdorthotrialplanning
Type: Package
Title: Orthopedic Clinical Trial Planning Using Win Ratio Methodology
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maintainer", "Name", email = "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Statistical analysis tools for orthopedic clinical trial planning,
    focusing on win ratio methodology and Bayesian analysis. Includes functions
    for NORTA-based synthetic data generation, hierarchical endpoint analysis
    (death, ambulatory status, days at home), and power analysis via Monte Carlo
    simulation. Also provides a Shiny web application for interactive trial design.
